      "rulesText": "You play White and move first. Drag a piece, or click it and then a gold dot.\n\n- Win by checkmate. Stalemate and bare kings are draws.\n- Castling, en passant and promotion are in. Pawns promote to a queen when dropped on the last rank.\n- Press **Z** to take back your last move (Rookie's reply goes with it).\n\nLegality lives in a small rule module (`chess-rules.ts`); everything else (the pieces, board and setup) is data.",
